Write a query to show total revenue and average order value per restaurant.
Query  
  SELECT restaurants_id, SUM(Total_amount) AS Total_revenue, AVG(Total_amount) AS Order_per_value FROM orders GROUP BY restaurants_id;

Write a query using HAVING to list only restaurants whose total revenue exceeds Rs 5,000
Query
  SELECT restaurants_id, SUM(Total_amount) AS Total_revenue_exceed FROM orders GROUP BY restaurants_id HAVING SUM(Total_amount) > 5000;

Write a query to retrieve the 5 most recent orders using ORDER BY and LIMIT.
Query
  SELECT Customer_name FROM orders ORDER BY Total_amount DESC,Order_date DESC LIMIT 5;
